            "description": "",
            "summary": "The regulatory statement followed a Bloomberg News report on Sunday that BHP \u2014 which had already failed in a bid for Anglo last year \u2014 made a new overture in recent days.  Anglo rejected that new approach, according to people familiar with the situation, having reviewed the proposal and decided that it was not superior to the combination with Teck.  The mining giant\u2019s overture comes just weeks before shareholders from Anglo and Teck are scheduled to vote on their own deal to create a company worth more than $60 billion, \u2014 effectively putting two long-coveted, copper-rich targets further out of reach.",
